ss=\"p4-mini-hint\">基線天數、計算日期、整體偏差與建立狀態</div></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-kpis\">\n        <article class=\"p4-kpi\"><div class=\"p4-kpi-icon\">▦</div><div><div class=\"p4-kpi-val\" ng-style=\"{color:blDays()>=14?'#86efac':blDays()>=7?'#fde047':'#fda4af'}\">{{blDays()}}</div><div class=\"p4-kpi-label\">基線使用天數</div></div></article>\n        <article class=\"p4-kpi\"><div class=\"p4-kpi-icon\">◷</div><div><div class=\"p4-kpi-val\">{{blDate()}}</div><div class=\"p4-kpi-label\">最近計算日期</div></div></article>\n        <article class=\"p4-kpi\"><div class=\"p4-kpi-icon\">◇</div><div><div class=\"p4-kpi-val\" ng-style=\"{color:devColorOverall()}\">{{devOv()!=null?devOv()+'%':'--'}}</div><div class=\"p4-kpi-label\">整體偏差</div></div></article>\n        <article class=\"p4-kpi\"><div class=\"p4-kpi-icon\">◎</div><div><div class=\"p4-kpi-val\">{{blReady()?'已建立':v2Insufficient?'資料不足':'建立中'}}</div><div class=\"p4-kpi-label\">基線狀態</div></div></article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p4-compact-panel\">\n      <div class=\"p4-mini-head\"><div class=\"p4-mini-title\"><span class=\"p4-row-no\">02</span>四時段資料覆蓋</div><div class=\"p4-mini-hint\">每時段監控超過 5 分鐘才計入有效覆蓋</div></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-periods\"><article class=\"p4-period\" ng-repeat=\"p in periods\"><div class=\"p4-period-top\"><span class=\"p4-period-icon\">{{covEmoji(periodData(p))}}</span><span class=\"p4-period-name\">{{p}}</span></div><div class=\"p4-period-days\" ng-style=\"{color:covColor(periodData(p))}\">{{periodData(p).covered}} / {{periodData(p).total}} 天</div></article></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-confidence\"><div class=\"p4-conf-icon\" ng-style=\"{color:confColor()}\">{{confidenceIcon()}}</div><div class=\"p4-conf-main\" ng-style=\"{color:confColor()}\">{{bl&&bl.confidence||'Low'}} · {{confDesc()}}</div><div class=\"p4-conf-desc\">Low &lt; 7 天 · Medium 7–29 天 · High ≥ 30 天</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"p4-panel p4-main-metrics\" ng-if=\"blReady()\">\n    <div class=\"p4-panel-head\"><div class=\"p4-panel-title\"><span class=\"p4-row-no\">03</span>11 類個體化基線指標</div><div class=\"p4-panel-hint\">今日值、此貓基線、Median、Z-score 與狀態</div></div>\n    <div class=\"p4-table-wrap\"><table class=\"p4-table\"><thead><tr><th>指標</th><th>今日</th><th>此貓基線 Mean ± Std</th><th>Median</th><th>Z-score</th><th>狀態</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr ng-repeat=\"r in rows\"><td><span class=\"p4-metric-name\">{{r.ico}} {{r.lbl}}</span></td><td>{{formatMetric(todayRaw(r),r)}}</td><td class=\"p4-baseline-cell\">{{formatMetric(blRaw(r,'mean'),r)}} ± {{formatMetric(blRaw(r,'std'),r)}}</td><td>{{formatMetric(blRaw(r,'median'),r)}}</td><td ng-style=\"{color:devColor(r.key)}\">{{devPct(r.key)}}</td><td><span class=\"p4-sigma\" ng-class=\"sigClsByRow(r)\">{{sigText(r)}}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n    <div class=\"p4-mobile-metrics\"><article class=\"p4-metric-card\" ng-repeat=\"r in rows\"><div class=\"p4-metric-card-head\"><span>{{r.ico}} {{r.lbl}}</span><span class=\"p4-sigma\" ng-class=\"sigClsByRow(r)\">{{sigText(r)}}</span></div><div class=\"p4-metric-today\" ng-style=\"{color:devColor(r.key)}\">{{formatMetric(todayRaw(r),r)}} · {{devPct(r.key)}}</div><div class=\"p4-metric-grid\"><div class=\"p4-metric-mini\"><small>Mean</small><strong>{{formatMetric(blRaw(r,'mean'),r)}}</strong></div><div class=\"p4-metric-mini\"><small>Std</small><strong>{{formatMetric(blRaw(r,'std'),r)}}</strong></div><div class=\"p4-metric-mini\"><small>Median</small><strong>{{formatMetric(blRaw(r,'median'),r)}}</strong></div><div class=\"p4-metric-mini\"><small>Z-score</small><strong>{{devPct(r.key)}}</strong></div></div></article></div>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"p4-panel p4-empty p4-main-metrics\" ng-if=\"!blReady()\"><div class=\"p4-panel-head\"><div class=\"p4-panel-title\"><span class=\"p4-row-no\">03</span>11 類個體化基線指標</div></div><div class=\"p4-empty-icon\">{{v2Insufficient?'!':'▥'}}</div><div class=\"p4-empty-title\">{{v2Insufficient?'有效資料不足':'個體化基線建立中'}}</div><div class=\"p4-empty-copy\">目前累積 {{histDays()}} 天，需要至少 {{reqDays()}} 天有效資料。<br>{{v2Insufficient?'請調整基線天數或等待更多有效資料。':'系統達到門檻後會自動啟動計算。'}}</div><div class=\"p4-progress\"><div class=\"p4-progress-fill\" ng-style=\"{width:histProgress()+'%'}\"></div></div></section>\n\n  <section class=\"p4-followups\">\n    <section class=\"p4-panel\">\n      <div class=\"p4-panel-head\"><div class=\"p4-panel-title\">Population Reference 對照</div><div class=\"p4-panel-hint\">主要三行之後的文獻合理性參考</div></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-ref-list\"><div class=\"p4-ref-head\"><span>類別</span><span>今日</span><span>群體參考</span><span>此貓基線</span></div><article class=\"p4-ref-item\" ng-repeat=\"r in referenceRows\"><div class=\"p4-ref-name\"><strong>{{r.ico}} {{r.name}}</strong><small>{{r.note}}</small></div><span class=\"p4-ref-today\">{{referenceToday(r)}}</span><span class=\"p4-ref-literature\">{{r.literature}}</span><span class=\"p4-ref-baseline\">{{referenceBaseline(r)}}</span></article></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-sanity warn\" ng-if=\"blReady()&&sanityWarn()\">⚠ 基線合理性提醒：{{sanityWarn()}}</div><div class=\"p4-sanity ok\" ng-if=\"blReady()&&!sanityWarn()\">✓ 合理性驗證通過；結果屬於行為觀察，不是疾病診斷。</div><div class=\"p4-sanity warn\" ng-if=\"!blReady()\">○ 個體基線尚未建立，群體數值僅供文獻參考。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"p4-panel p4-settings-panel\">\n      <div class=\"p4-panel-head\"><div class=\"p4-panel-title\">基本設定摘要</div><div class=\"p4-panel-hint\">主要三行之後顯示目前生效值</div></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-settings-summary\">\n        <div class=\"p4-profile\"><div><div class=\"p4-profile-name\">🐱 {{settings.cat_name||'尚未設定貓咪名稱'}}</div><div class=\"p4-profile-meta\">{{settings.cat_breed||'品種未設定'}} · {{catAgeStr()||'出生年月未設定'}}</div></div><span class=\"p4-setting-pill\"><strong>{{settings.baseline_days}}</strong> 天基線</span></div>\n        <div class=\"p4-setting-stats\"><div class=\"p4-setting-stat\"><span>目前使用</span><strong>{{blDays()}} 天</strong></div><div class=\"p4-setting-stat\"><span>最低需求</span><strong>{{settings.baseline_days}} 天</strong></div><div class=\"p4-setting-stat\"><span>信心水準</span><strong ng-style=\"{color:confColor()}\">{{bl&&bl.confidence||'Low'}}</strong></div></div>\n        <div class=\"p4-setting-pills\"><span class=\"p4-setting-pill\">通知靈敏度：<strong>{{notifyLevelName(settings.notify_level)}}</strong></span><span class=\"p4-setting-pill\">Discord：<strong>{{settings.discord_webhook?'已設定':'未設定'}}</strong></span></div>\n        <div class=\"p4-summary-label\">Behavior thresholds · 行為警戒值</div>\n        <div class=\"p4-thresholds\"><div class=\"p4-threshold\"><span>舔舐</span><strong>{{settings.lick_pct}}%</strong></div><div class=\"p4-threshold\"><span>搔抓</span><strong>{{settings.scratch_pct}}%</strong></div><div class=\"p4-threshold\"><span>甩頭</span><strong>{{settings.shake_pct}}%</strong></div><div class=\"p4-threshold\"><span>靜止</span><strong>{{settings.stop_pct}}%</strong></div><div class=\"p4-threshold\"><span>轉移</span><strong>{{settings.lsc_count}} 次</strong></div></div>\n        <div class=\"p4-notify-rule\"><strong>目前通知條件：</strong>{{notifyLevelDesc(settings.notify_level)}}</div>\n        <button class=\"p4-edit-btn\" ng-click=\"settingsOpen=true\">⚙ 編輯完整設定</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"p4-actionbar\">\n    <button class=\"p4-tool-btn\" ng-click=\"evtOpen=!evtOpen\">📌 今日事件標記<span class=\"p4-tool-meta\">就醫、換糧與壓力事件</span><span class=\"p4-chevron\" ng-class=\"{open:evtOpen}\">⌄</span></button>\n    <button class=\"p4-tool-btn\" ng-click=\"histOpen=!histOpen\">▤ 歷史資料管理<span class=\"p4-tool-meta\">最近 30 天 · 逐日行為·z分數·排除</span><span class=\"p4-chevron\" ng-class=\"{open:histOpen}\">⌄</span></button>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"p4-drawer\" ng-if=\"evtOpen\"><div class=\"p4-events-layout\"><div><div class=\"p4-subtitle\">今天 · {{todayDateStr()}}</div><div class=\"p4-evt-tags\"><span class=\"p4-evt-tag\" ng-repeat=\"t in evtTagDefs\" ng-class=\"{active:selTags.indexOf(t.key)>=0}\" ng-click=\"toggleTag(t.key)\">{{t.ico}} {{t.lbl}}</span></div><input type=\"text\" ng-model=\"$parent.evtNote\" placeholder=\"自訂備註（選填）\"><div class=\"p4-actions\"><button class=\"p4-btn primary block\" ng-click=\"saveEvent()\">記錄今日事件</button></div></div><div><div class=\"p4-subtitle\">近期事件</div><div class=\"p4-evt-hist-row\" ng-repeat=\"e in recentEvents\"><span class=\"p4-evt-date\">{{e.date}}</span><span class=\"p4-evt-tags-text\">{{e.tags.join(' · ')}}</span><span class=\"p4-evt-note\" ng-if=\"e.note\"> — {{e.note}}</span></div><div class=\"p4-empty-copy\" ng-if=\"recentEvents.length===0\">尚無事件記錄</div></div></div></section>\n\n  <section class=\"p4-drawer\" ng-if=\"histOpen\"><div class=\"p4-subtitle\">異常事件日可暫時排除，排除後會立即重算個體基線</div><div class=\"p4-hist-list\"><div class=\"p4-hist-row\" ng-repeat=\"d in historyDays\" ng-class=\"{excluded:excludedDates.indexOf(d.date)>=0}\"><div class=\"p4-hist-top\" ng-click=\"d._open=!d._open\"><div class=\"p4-hist-date\">{{d.date}} <span class=\"p4-hist-chev\" ng-class=\"{open:d._open}\">⌄</span></div><div class=\"p4-hist-info\"><span class=\"p4-hist-hrs\">{{d.hrs}}h</span><span class=\"p4-pill ok\" ng-if=\"d.valid&&excludedDates.indexOf(d.date)<0\">✓ 計入</span><span class=\"p4-pill excl\" ng-if=\"excludedDates.indexOf(d.date)>=0\">✕ 排除中</span><span class=\"p4-pill short\" ng-if=\"!d.valid\">監控過短</span><span class=\"p4-pill {{d.risk.cls}}\" ng-if=\"d.risk\">{{d.risk.short}}</span><span ng-if=\"d.hasEvt\" title=\"{{d.evtText}}\">📌</span><span class=\"p4-hist-missing\" ng-if=\"d.missing&&d.missing.length\">缺 {{d.missing.join('、')}}</span><span class=\"p4-z {{z.cls}}\" ng-repeat=\"z in d.zchips\">{{z.label}} {{z.val}}</span><span class=\"p4-z-more\" ng-if=\"d.zmore\">＋{{d.zmore}} 項偏離</span></div><button ng-if=\"d.valid\" class=\"p4-excl-btn\" ng-class=\"{active:excludedDates.indexOf(d.date)>=0}\" ng-click=\"$event.stopPropagation();toggleExclude(d.date)\">{{excludedDates.indexOf(d.date)>=0?'取消排除':'排除此天'}}</button></div><div class=\"p4-hist-summary\" ng-click=\"d._open=!d._open\">{{d.summary}}</div><div class=\"p4-hist-expand\" ng-if=\"d._open\"><div class=\"p4-he-evt\" ng-if=\"d.evtText\">📌 {{d.evtText}}</div><table class=\"p4-he-tbl\"><thead><tr><th>時段</th><th>🚶</th><th>😸</th><th>🐾</th><th>↻</th><th>☾</th><th>監控</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr ng-repeat=\"pr in d.periodRows\"><td>{{pr.name}}</td><td>{{pr.walk}}</td><td>{{pr.lick}}</td><td>{{pr.scratch}}</td><td>{{pr.shake}}</td><td>{{pr.stop}}</td><td>{{pr.mon}}</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"p4-he-zall\"><span class=\"p4-z {{z.cls}}\" ng-repeat=\"z in d.zall\">{{z.label}} {{z.val}}</span></div><div class=\"p4-he-loo\" ng-if=\"d.loo&&d.loo.length\">排除此天 → 基線位移（近似預覽）：{{d.loo.join(' · ')}}</div><div class=\"p4-he-loo\" ng-if=\"!d.zall.length\">（基線尚未建立，無法比對）</div></div></div><div class=\"p4-empty-copy\" ng-if=\"historyDays.length===0\">尚無歷史資料</div></div><div class=\"p4-del-zone\"><input type=\"text\" ng-model=\"$parent.deleteDateInput\" placeholder=\"YYYY/M/D，例如 2026/6/12\"><button class=\"p4-btn danger\" ng-click=\"confirmDeleteDay()\">永久刪除此天</button><div class=\"p4-del-hint\">此操作無法復原；如果只是不希望這天影響基線，請使用「排除此天」。</div><div class=\"p4-error\" ng-if=\"deleteError\">{{deleteError}}</div></div></section>\n\n  <div class=\"p4-modal-backdrop\" ng-if=\"settingsOpen\" ng-click=\"$parent.settingsOpen=false\">\n    <div class=\"p4-modal\" ng-click=\"$event.stopPropagation()\">\n      <div class=\"p4-modal-head\"><div><div class=\"p4-modal-title\">⚙ 飼主與監控設定</div><div class=\"p4-modal-sub\">貓咪資料 · 個體基線 · 行為閾值 · Discord</div></div><button class=\"p4-modal-close\" ng-click=\"$parent.settingsOpen=false\" aria-label=\"關閉設定\">×</button></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-form-grid\">\n        <div class=\"p4-form-group\"><div class=\"p4-set-divider\">Cat profile</div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">名字</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"text\" ng-model=\"settings.cat_name\" placeholder=\"例：小花\"></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">品種</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"text\" ng-model=\"settings.cat_breed\" placeholder=\"例：混種貓（選填）\"></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">出生年月</div><div class=\"p4-date-inputs\"><input type=\"number\" ng-model=\"settings.cat_birth_year\" min=\"2000\" max=\"2030\" placeholder=\"年\"><span class=\"p4-form-unit\">年</span><input type=\"number\" ng-model=\"settings.cat_birth_month\" min=\"1\" max=\"12\" placeholder=\"月\"><span class=\"p4-form-unit\">月</span></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-age\">{{catAgeStr()}}</div><div class=\"p4-set-divider\">Baseline</div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">基線最少天數</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"3\" max=\"14\" step=\"1\" ng-model=\"settings.baseline_days\"><span class=\"p4-set-num\">{{settings.baseline_days}} 天</span></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-hint\">達到門檻才開始建立；系統最多使用最近 30 天有效資料。</div></div>\n        <div class=\"p4-form-group\"><div class=\"p4-set-divider\">Behavior thresholds</div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">舔舐上限</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"50\" step=\"1\" ng-model=\"settings.lick_pct\"><span class=\"p4-set-num\">{{settings.lick_pct}}%</span></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">搔抓上限</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"5\" max=\"40\" step=\"1\" ng-model=\"settings.scratch_pct\"><span class=\"p4-set-num\">{{settings.scratch_pct}}%</span></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">甩頭上限</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"3\" max=\"30\" step=\"1\" ng-model=\"settings.shake_pct\"><span class=\"p4-set-num\">{{settings.shake_pct}}%</span></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">靜止上限</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"30\" max=\"80\" step=\"5\" ng-model=\"settings.stop_pct\"><span class=\"p4-set-num\">{{settings.stop_pct}}%</span></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">轉移警戒</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"3\" max=\"30\" step=\"1\" ng-model=\"settings.lsc_count\"><span class=\"p4-set-num\">{{settings.lsc_count}} 次</span></div></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p4-set-divider\">Notifications</div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">通知靈敏度</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"3\" step=\"1\" ng-model=\"settings.notify_level\"><span class=\"p4-set-num\">{{notifyLevelName(settings.notify_level)}}</span></div></div><div class=\"p4-set-hint\">{{notifyLevelDesc(settings.notify_level)}}</div><div class=\"p4-set-row\"><div class=\"p4-set-lbl\">Discord Webhook</div><div class=\"p4-set-ctrl\"><input type=\"password\" ng-model=\"settings.discord_webhook\" placeholder=\"https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...\"></div></div><div class=\"p4-actions\"><button class=\"p4-btn primary block\" ng-click=\"saveSettings()\">儲存並套用設定</button><button class=\"p4-btn secondary block\" ng-click=\"testDiscord()\">傳送測試通知</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p4-baseline-warning-backdrop\" ng-if=\"baselineWarning.open\" role=\"alertdialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"重要基線警告\">\n    <div class=\"p4-baseline-warning\" ng-class=\"baselineWarning.type\">\n      <div class=\"p4-baseline-warning-head\"><div class=\"p4-baseline-warning-icon\">{{baselineWarning.type==='error'?'!':baselineWarning.type==='protect'?'◆':'⚠'}}</div><div><div class=\"p4-baseline-warning-kicker\">Baseline protection · 基線保護</div><div class=\"p4-baseline-warning-title\">{{baselineWarning.title}}</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-baseline-warning-message\">{{baselineWarning.message}}</div>\n      <div class=\"p4-baseline-warning-note\"><span>ⓘ</span><span>為維持個體基線可信度，系統必須保留足夠的有效監測天數。請確認提示內容後再調整排除日期。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"p4-baseline-warning-actions\"><button class=\"p4-baseline-warning-btn\" ng-click=\"dismissBaselineWarning()\">我知道了</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p4-toast\" ng-if=\"toast.open\" ng-class=\"toast.type\"><span class=\"p4-toast-icon\">{{toast.icon}}</span><span class=\"p4-toast-copy\">{{toast.message}}</span></div>\n  <div class=\"p4-modal-backdrop\" ng-if=\"deleteModalOpen\" ng-click=\"cancelDelete()\"><div class=\"p4-modal danger-modal\" ng-click=\"$event.stopPropagation()\"><div class=\"p4-modal-icon\">!</div><div class=\"p4-modal-title\" style=\"margin-top:13px\">永久刪除 {{pendingDeleteDate}}？</div><div class=\"p4-modal-copy\">這一天的所有基線資料將被清除，而且無法復原。若只是不希望這天影響基線，建議改用「排除此天」。</div><div class=\"p4-modal-actions\"><button class=\"p4-btn secondary\" ng-click=\"cancelDelete()\">取消</button><button class=\"p4-btn danger\" ng-click=\"executeDeleteDay()\">確認永久刪除</button></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(scope){\n  scope.rows=[\n    {ico:'😸',lbl:'舔舐次數',key:'lick_count',metric:'lick_count',type:'count'},{ico:'😸',lbl:'舔舐時間',key:'lick_time',metric:'lick_time',type:'time'},\n    {ico:'🐾',lbl:'搔抓次數',key:'scratch_count',metric:'scratch_count',type:'count'},{ico:'🐾',lbl:'搔抓時間',key:'scratch_time',metric:'scratch_time',type:'time'},\n    {ico:'↻',lbl:'甩頭次數',key:'shake_count',metric:'shake_count',type:'count'},{ico:'🚶',lbl:'行走次數',key:'walk_count',metric:'walk_count',type:'count'},\n    {ico:'🚶',lbl:'行走時間',key:'walk_time',metric:'walk_time',type:'time'},{ico:'☾',lbl:'靜止時間',key:'stop_time',metric:'stop_time',type:'time'},\n    {ico:'😸',lbl:'舔舐佔活動時間',key:'lick_pct_active',metric:'lick_pct_active',type:'pct'},{ico:'🐾',lbl:'搔抓佔活動時間',key:'scratch_pct_active',metric:'scratch_pct_active',type:'pct'},\n    {ico:'🏃',lbl:'活動時間佔比',key:'active_ratio',metric:'active_ratio',type:'pct'}\n  ];\n  scope.referenceRows=[\n    {ico:'😸',name:'舔舐時間 / 天',key:'lick_time',metric:'lick_time',type:'time',literature:'約 60 分鐘',note:'健康室內成貓口腔梳理參考'},\n    {ico:'🐾',name:'搔抓時間 / 天',key:'scratch_time',metric:'scratch_time',type:'time',literature:'約 1 分鐘',note:'健康室內成貓搔抓梳理參考'},\n    {ico:'😸',name:'舔舐佔活動時間',key:'lick_pct_active',metric:'lick_pct_active',type:'pct',literature:'約 8%',note:'排除睡眠與休息時間'},\n    {ico:'🐾',name:'搔抓佔活動時間',key:'scratch_pct_active',metric:'scratch_pct_active',type:'pct',literature:'約 0.2%',note:'排除睡眠與休息時間'},\n    {ico:'🏃',name:'活動時間佔比',key:'active_ratio',metric:'active_ratio',type:'pct',literature:'約 43%',note:'佔全天監控時間比例'}\n  ];\n  scope.periods=['00-06','06-12','12-18','18-24'];scope.bl=null;scope.dev=null;scope.settings={baseline_days:7,lick_pct:20,scratch_pct:15,shake_pct:10,stop_pct:55,lsc_count:10,notify_level:2,discord_webhook:'',cat_name:'',cat_breed:'',cat_birth_year:0,cat_birth_month:1};\n  scope.settingsOpen=false;scope.evtOpen=false;scope.histOpen=false;scope._settingsSaving=false;scope._excludePending=false;scope.v2Insufficient=false;scope.selTags=[];scope.evtNote='';scope.recentEvents=[];scope.historyDays=[];scope.excludedDates=[];scope.deleteDateInput='';scope.deleteError='';scope.deleteModalOpen=false;scope.pendingDeleteDate='';scope.toast={open:false,type:'success',icon:'✓',message:''};var toastTimer=null;\n  scope.baselineWarning={open:false,type:'warn',title:'',message:''};scope.showBaselineWarning=function(type,title,message){scope.baselineWarning={open:true,type:type||'warn',title:title||'個體基線提醒',message:String(message||'')};};scope.dismissBaselineWarning=function(){scope.baselineWarning.open=false;};scope.init=function(){};scope.payload=function(){return scope.msg&&scope.msg.payload?scope.msg.payload:{};};scope.showToast=function(type,message){var icons={success:'✓',warn:'!',error:'×',info:'i'};if(toastTimer)clearTimeout(toastTimer);scope.toast={open:true,type:type,icon:icons[type]||'i',message:message};toastTimer=setTimeout(function(){scope.$evalAsync(function(){scope.toast.open=false;});},4200);};\n  scope.notifyLevelName=function(v){return ['','低','中','高'][+v||2];};scope.notifyLevelDesc=function(v){return ['','只有高風險（分數 ≥ 70）才推播','警告以上（分數 ≥ 45）推播','留意以上（分數 ≥ 20）即推播'][+v||2];};\n  scope.catAgeStr=function(){var y=parseInt(scope.settings.cat_birth_year)||